# No long cache on /assets: while a deploy rolls out, a request for a new file
# can briefly get the site's index.html (the /* fallback in _redirects), and a
# long Cache-Control would pin that wrong response in Cloudflare's and browsers'
# caches. Pages' default (revalidate) keeps a glitch like that momentary.
# Fonts keep fixed names and exist in every deploy.
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000
